        <mxCell id="legend_title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A2027;align=left;" value="Key takeaways" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="22" width="300" x="120" y="934" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend_body" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;fontColor=#3C4A5A;spacingLeft=4;" value="•  &lt;b&gt;eBGP&lt;/b&gt; (r1↔r4): different AS → AS-path grows, next-hop set automatically.&#xa;•  &lt;b&gt;iBGP&lt;/b&gt; (r1↔r2, r1↔r3): same AS → AS-path unchanged, needs &lt;b&gt;next-hop-self&lt;/b&gt; on r1.&#xa;•  &lt;b&gt;Route Reflector&lt;/b&gt;: r1 reflects routes between r2 &amp; r3 (no full mesh). Stamps &lt;b&gt;Originator-ID&lt;/b&gt; + &lt;b&gt;Cluster-list&lt;/b&gt; for loop prevention.&#xa;•  A reflected route stays &lt;b&gt;inaccessible&lt;/b&gt; until an &lt;b&gt;IGP (OSPF/IS-IS)&lt;/b&gt; resolves the next-hop → that&#39;s Day 4." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="660" x="120" y="958" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
